ve","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/49d872e77576e6b99dbb13581a2740a2211f43253e588d52d57c25023ddb987f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25cefd5af17522d92c811c221b5080945fed71c89b2663829cdc1c9a0e3bf4da.webp","width":82,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三上枝織","creatorId":"vndb:s7957","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7957","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7957","name":"三上 枝織","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:222871:169748:5105:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_169749","characterName":"Bazalt Joe","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"169749","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Bazalt Joe","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/435a316be2fa7a8e3cb864d6e9e1b8dd879f84281aead2506e59386fb0707c67.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71828505f66e36ff1e448cb23e0befdabff96ff810749811da82d5511e495f79.webp","width":120,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小山力也","creatorId":"vndb:s1941","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1941","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1941","name":"小山 力也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:222871:169749:4130:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_169750","characterName":"Lievre","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"169750","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Lievre","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a1b0fec8600ffbe12e8606d155b12cad55101c8ec9eb979042013f3f18093017.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b3340fc8ed0e5df64e2218215048df8e52c316e15a69aeb67647e4f4f518437.webp","width":137,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鬼頭明里","creatorId":"vndb:s15238","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15238","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15238","name":"鬼頭明里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:222871:169750:19339:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_17646","characterName":"Leafa","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"17646","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"},{"characterId":"17646","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"52405"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Leafa","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"和人现实世界的妹妹，15岁，被和人昵称“小直”，妖精之舞篇登场的另一位女主角。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"剑道少女，从小毫不间断地挥舞了8年竹刀的努力女孩。是在国中时挤进全国前8名，仅仅高一就获选参加全国大赛的好手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小时候和和人是感情很好的兄妹，因为和人的缘故开始学习剑道。在和人想放弃剑道而被祖父责骂时，哭喊著自己会连哥哥的份一起努力而持续剑道至今。但在和人放弃剑道而迷上电脑后，兄妹间渐渐不太讲话。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和人被关进SAO的世界后，开始对两人之间的冷漠关系感到后悔。听到和人正在SAO最前线奋战的消息而燃起希望，尽心尽力的照顾和人的身体。为了更了解和人，开始踏入自己讨厌的网络游戏世界。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"SAO事件发生后，得知和人不是自己的亲哥哥而是“表哥”，在懂事前因姨父姨母车祸死亡而被自己家收为养子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在ALO中的角色为风精灵“莉法”，是族内排名前五名的实力玩家。遭火精灵集团猎杀时被“桐人”搭救，在双方都没有发现对方真正身分的情况下，莉法教导还是ALO新手的桐人基础知识与自力飞行的诀窍，并自告奋勇担任桐人前往世界树的导游。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"游戏内不断被一起冒险的桐人吸引，在现实世界也有如溃堤般发觉自己对和人的心意。了解到和人和明日奈的羁绊与“桐人”就是“和人”后，非常消沉与自责。受到同班同学长田鼓励后才鼓起勇气重新面对和人，和桐人再次挑战世界树。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"17646"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a506ccb9adf61c48dfd9e27935f6d763a96da3b17644fb563b69cb339455147b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/980d9e95736d96cb2b93d78e732e35cca7bf182d40a9eb82e76a0bff308e7d63.webp","width":68,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_17647","characterName":"唯","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"17647","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"},{"characterId":"17647","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"52405"}]},"originalCharacterName":"唯","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0801"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"倒在桐人和亚丝娜过新婚生活的艾恩葛朗特22层森林里的小女孩。除了记忆错乱，身边还有许多不可解的Bug现象。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真正身分是SAO的MHCP，负责维护玩家精神健康的咨询用AI。当游戏变质为死亡游戏时被剥夺了主动接触玩家的权限，在有义务却没权力执行的矛盾累积下，AI出现错误并丢失部分记忆，游荡到发出强烈正面情绪的桐人和亚丝娜附近并被发现和收养，在前往一层黑铁宫时重新接触安置在那里的紧急管理界面，记忆被修复并道出自己的真正身份，但也因此被Cardinal系统发现，在被系统消去前，因桐人的努力而以道具的状态被保留下来及数据被桐人保全在桐人的NERvGear中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然只是AI，却拥有不输给人类的丰富感情（本人却表示那只是透过模仿及学习的结果），个性有如孩子般天真无邪，把桐人和亚丝娜当成真正的“爸爸”和“妈妈”般仰慕。取回身为AI的记忆后，变成会用正式的语调讲话。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在延用SAO系统的ALO中，以“导航妖精”的身分复活，辅助桐人挑战世界树，一起寻找妈妈亚丝娜。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"于ALO事件后定居在和人房间的电脑主机中，在现实世界中会透过手机来对话。拥有任何检索达人也比不上的情报能力，和人等人经常倚赖结衣的帮忙完成学校作业。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"17647"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0860c170429e7c52808459417bc7882c25e888dae53501a5b203ec439b44577.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/361d6bdf22abdc97535c499529b5022a8c38748674ff729c55d4021a1404365b.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_22533","characterName":"Philia","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22533","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Philia","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"初登场于《虚空断章》的女角色。PSVita“虚空区”原创剧情里的角色，因75层桐人和希兹克利夫战斗时发生的系统障碍而被传送至虚空区时被桐人意外所救的女玩家。在《失落之歌》中亦有登场，种族设定为守护精灵。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22533"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a795ca1ee6486f7c5f0e2a1c153490c999fd0572ef1e3d0faaa13243ca68319.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a7e13019b0a0cf9974b94f2f19d497333a0a082fe3fe14f005bf00801ac90fc.webp","width":103,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_22535","characterName":"Strea","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22535","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"},{"characterId":"22535","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"52405"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Strea","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"初登场于《无限瞬间》的女角色。真身是与结衣相同的MHCP程式，代号为MHCP2号STREA。在《虚空断章》登场时为“艾恩葛朗特”第100层的BOSS之一。在《失落之歌》中亦有登场，种族设定为大地精灵。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22535"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c92c1f81c075febedc0820056530e668af1ab7889d30cea409c9e4a8ae3f1606.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4bf0c9a1df0476c508ee13d28ce3eefb8fbe8faa58819ba7ba35a079cc60c39e.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_25240","characterName":"诗浓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"25240","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"},{"characterId":"25240","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"52405"}]},"originalCharacterName":"诗浓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幽灵子弹篇的女主角。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在Gun Gale Online（GGO）中使用自己昵称为“黑卡蒂II”的狙击步枪“PGM Ultima Ratio HecateII（动画版第二话开头用FR-F2狙击步枪）”及“HK MP7冲锋枪（动画版改为Glock18C手枪）”的15岁少女，2009年出生。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25240"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e233f23c6aae02f96e7628b1e322e9fd3e66c0d1623501e4067cc88ef35ef109.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8d061c5c211417d5b0f08ae5689917511d8f9e45f76fd0a789e225740c5ca1b7.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_25976","characterName":"优吉欧","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"25976","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"}]},"originalCharacterName":"优吉欧","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0410"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"桐人的拍挡，桐人在这个世界中最先遇到的居民。身负砍断恶魔之树“基加斯西达”的天职。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25976"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/384bfea4bd1d9b6eb7600eac3331f161b7dd62ff804d00546c40a1430c706195.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/197996bf29ba996768657946e68f409cdaa9f05f93d68a2abb51715ad2afe3f1.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_27331","characterName":"优纪","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"27331","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"}]},"originalCharacterName":"优纪","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"圣母圣咏篇的女主角。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生日为2011年5月23日，喜欢的食物为可丽饼，与双胞胎姐姐蓝子有着绝佳的默契。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"从其他VRMMO转移来新生ALO的玩家，暗精灵，使用武器为单手剑。少数使用现实世界本名当做角色名的玩家。在ALO艾恩葛朗特24层的大树下，以自己的十一连击OSS为赌注和其他玩家进行路边决斗，因为创下在对决包含未使用二刀流的桐人在内超过60人以上连胜无败的纪录而有“绝剑（Zekken）”的称号，那压倒性的强悍令亚丝娜等SAO生还者们也觉得惊讶。被桐人认为如果她也在SAO中，习得二刀流的人不是自己而是她。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27331"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6a/6a35eb4c96ff87a7a2fb09f6993bd7d9e5047d09284de899e569eb1ec0a8e1b8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e8721742fcda3f016081d6d608efdcec9ac653fd056483876dd84c8ffce75ad1.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29735","characterName":"アリス・ツーベルク／アリス・シンセシス・サーティ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29735","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"}]},"originalCharacterName":"アリス・ツーベルク／アリス・シンセシス・サーティ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0409"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Alicization篇的女主角。卢利特村村长的女儿，有着村内最高的神圣术天赋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"尤吉欧与桐人的童年玩伴，三人十一岁那年的一场探险让她误触禁忌目录而被整合骑士押往央都，一度生死不明。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29735"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71934a1ee29e6529bcd2a0c3d6ccb4eb0300d9969cc2e8b9e58207cb28703b3f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2eacecb61212bfc67c9e616a565f192833c1b18d148c4380fac253b04fcb5977.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_41079","characterName":"premiere","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"41079","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"}]},"originalCharacterName":"premiere","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"桐人在《Sword Art Origin》中遇到的谜之少女。究竟是不是对此感兴趣……面无表情地从远处盯着桐人，并给桐人他们留下意味深长的信息。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"41079"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/6667a12b4fb4b8307d28478e6e774a1cc9d95a9d6761d0ab111a3a6869e53c84.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26c610776bc1f00776c1d8df0c6497afb021cbfb8841d50a54c5f9ee14b3bdee.webp","width":186,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_42339","characterName":"Rain","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"42339","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Rain","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0621"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"44"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"初登场于《失落之歌》的女角色，种族设定为小矮妖。使用两把单手剑的玩家，被称为“骗子”。现实世界中是七色失散已久的姐姐，姐妹俩的名字“虹架”与“七色”相互呼应，俄罗斯籍的父亲与日本籍的母亲离异后跟随母亲回到日本。SAO的生还者之一。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"42339"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ea/ea4b74bd5a47d258672641e9f52be7a22aa202b26134dfa44c053f813a27cdd3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d87453fb4f6bc37f45973c28631e1f8678ab2df616b870e74d3b2dc865a1d35.webp","width":80,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_42340","characterName":"Seven／Nanairo Alsharvin","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"42340","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Seven／Nanairo Alsharvin","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"初登场于《失落之歌》的女角色，种族设定为音乐精灵。公会“三叶草”的领导人之一。现实世界中是虹架失散已久的妹妹，姐妹俩的名字“虹架”与“七色”相互呼应，俄罗斯籍的父亲与日本籍的母亲离异后跟随父亲移居美国。知名天才科学家，以美国麻省理工学院第一名之姿毕业，被喻为若茅场晶彦代表“黑暗”，其则代表“光明”。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"42340"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/571cd1127b35e55c9c858c562ea428fd3901b8e8cd47a183c8b255b5c177d6e5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/14034018f002bfedd0bd63ab0bbbc099eed2357aac75c96c3988a313b686fed3.webp","width":141,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_45786","characterName":"Spiegel","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"45786","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Spiegel","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71584723a318b4d23feee8cbd5f70d2a76542cc62ccb16d03c3f650db79be4ef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c4061dc2b0804e71a21a474c0f945b1b8f05bef9dcb7146409e0bc099d10998.webp","width":177,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_45790","characterName":"Pina","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"45790","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"222871"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Pina","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a5a755060e76f319241ff10cfb37a4c2f5cdc0bca3f295ada44fadfc33f8f70.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e9a7d29e